# Three Blind Mice. Turn 3 Bot1 casts it: chapter I makes a 1/1 white Mouse. Turn 5, chapter II copies the only token Bot1 controls
# (two Mice). Turn 7, chapter III targets a token: Bot1's Memnite is not a token, so it is no legal target, and a Mouse is copied
# (three Mice). Turn 9, chapter IV gives every creature Bot1 controls +1/+1 and vigilance until end of turn, then the Saga is
# sacrificed. On turn 11 the bonus is gone.

